{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 4120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 3120, "text": "Where is he?"}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 6060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4560, "text": "I can't take it anymore."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 8420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 6440, "text": "How long does it take to read a will?"}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 12160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 9820, "text": "Kwan Lee, just try to relax, huh?"}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 14540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 12400, "text": "Sit down. Mac will be back any minute."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 16700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 15580, "text": "I can't relax."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 19560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 17080, "text": "How can anyone relax at a time like\nthis?"}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 23020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 19960, "text": "Well, one sure way involves a pound of\nVelveeta and a copy of True Detective"}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 24020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 23020, "text": "magazine."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 26500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 25500, "text": "Hi, Kwan Lee."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 29720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 26780, "text": "I thought you were at the reading of\nGrandpa Robinson's will."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 31100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 30060, "text": "I chickened out."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 33380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 31560, "text": "Why? The guy was a millionaire."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 34920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 33660, "text": "Don't you want to know what you're\ngetting?"}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 36400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 35260, "text": "I know what we're getting."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 37720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 36640, "text": "Did we? What?"}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 40380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 39360, "text": "Wow, how much?"}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 46100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 42180, "text": "You see, Roz, Grandpa Robinson never\nreally got over the money he lost in Mac"}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 47140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 46100, "text": "and Quanley's restaurant."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 48660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 47520, "text": "That is so unfair."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 51080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 48860, "text": "A millionaire being upset about a few\ndollars."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 54020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 51440, "text": "Yeah, a measly 110 ,000 bucks."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 58180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 56440, "text": "110 ,000?"}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 60600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 58480, "text": "How could you ever go through that much\nmoney?"}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 65080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 61160, "text": "Well, we tried a lot of different\npromotions, but none of them ever worked"}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 66480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 65360, "text": "You know what my favorite was?"}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 68080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 66680, "text": "Make your own change night."}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 75720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 71420, "text": "Grandpa said that before he'd give us\nanother cent, he'd rather fall out of an"}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 78360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 75720, "text": "airplane into the mating fit of an\nalligator farm."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 80920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 79820, "text": "Little did he know."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 87040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 82720, "text": "Just the same quantity. I'm sure that\nMac will get a little tiny something as"}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 88040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 87040, "text": "memento."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 102100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 101100, "text": "I quit"}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 152380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 149560, "text": "Boy, this place sure has changed since\nMac left."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 156820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 152860, "text": "Yeah, it's the first time in my life I\never had paper cuts on my ankles."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 162080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 160400, "text": "I found tonight's docket, Judge."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 170680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 166080, "text": "That's swell, Eddie, and only four and a\nhalf hours after we started."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 175240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 172940, "text": "Here, sign this. What is it?"}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 176920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 175580, "text": "It's a stay of execution."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 179100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 178100, "text": "Well,"}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 181920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 179560, "text": "you remember that little old lady we had\nin here for loitering? Yeah."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 184260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 182340, "text": "I kind of put her on the wrong bus."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 190820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 189600, "text": "You sent Mrs."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 192420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 191040, "text": "Turley to death row?"}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 197300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 194360, "text": "Well, the funny part about it is that\nher lawyer thinks that you're the one"}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 198300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 197300, "text": "did it."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 203280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 199900, "text": "Hey, what does this phone message say? I\ncan't read your writing."}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 206540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 204120, "text": "Oh, some guy called. He wanted to know\nif you were naked."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 212180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 208680, "text": "He said he wanted to call you later, but\ndon't worry about it. I gave him your"}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 213180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 212180, "text": "home phone."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 219520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 216280, "text": "Sir, the holding cells are all full, and\nwe've got about 30 defendants waiting"}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 220319, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 219520, "text": "out in the hallway."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 222040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 220320, "text": "You just left them there unsupervised?"}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 223840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 222300, "text": "Yes, sir. They're on the horror system."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 228260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 225920, "text": "You mean the honor system."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 241160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 239400, "text": "idea how important he was to this place."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 242480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 241480, "text": "I miss Mac."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 243680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 242680, "text": "I miss Mac."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 244760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 243760, "text": "I miss Mac."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 247300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 244940, "text": "Hey, oh, blah -dee, oh, blah -da, babe.\nLife goes on."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 254280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 251760, "text": "How can you be so cavalier? Don't you\nmiss him?"}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 255700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 254560, "text": "No, I don't miss him."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 259560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 255900, "text": "There's no skin off my nose. Listen, I\ndon't care if I have to work with a guy"}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 262620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 259560, "text": "who cleans his ears with my fountain\npen."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 265260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 263840, "text": "Give me that, you frog."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 269910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 267790, "text": "to keep your stubby little fingers off\nmy stuff."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 272770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 270830, "text": "Jeez, is it okay if I breathe?"}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 279650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 277770, "text": "Judge, I want to take an early lunch."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 285250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 281190, "text": "Eddie, don't you think it'd be a real\nnifty idea if we got through at least"}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 286630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 285250, "text": "case first?"}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 290130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 287310, "text": "Why don't you just drop a yoke on my\nback and start plowing?"}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 294010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 292310, "text": "I got one here for Jones."}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 296310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 294750, "text": "Roz, we got a Jones over there?"}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 298240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 296760, "text": "We have two Joneses, sir."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 300620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 299120, "text": "Orville and Flamona."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 306560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 302700, "text": "Hey, Eddie, which one is it? Well, geez,\nI don't know. I kind of got the files a"}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 309640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 306560, "text": "little mixed up here. I mean, what are\nthe odds of two people being named"}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 315720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 312960, "text": "You two get down here. I'll try to sort\nthrough this thing."}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 319040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 316840, "text": "Mr. Prosecutor. Yes, sir."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 324060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 319460, "text": "Mr. Jones here owns a tenement building.\nHe's been cited for numerous violations"}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 325340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 324060, "text": "and at a meeting of the..."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 329180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 325680, "text": "Housing department, he stripped down to\na lace camisole and pranced around the"}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 330180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 329180, "text": "room like a show pony."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 334560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 333560, "text": "Slut."}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 340800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 337500, "text": "I think I am the show pony in question."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 343720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 341420, "text": "Yeah, I'm no pervert."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 345580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 344200, "text": "I'm a slumlord."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 348560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 347000, "text": "Mr. Honor, this is hopeless."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 351140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 348900, "text": "We will get through it, Miss Sullivan."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 355870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 351400, "text": "I don't care if we stay here all night.\nNothing is going to stop... us from"}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 362150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 355870, "text": "finishing this case fire geez"}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 367470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 362150, "text": "this wouldn't happen if you had some\nashtrays around here"}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 374430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 367470, "text": "okay that's it court's adjourned well\neddie you've"}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 379390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 374430, "text": "done it you've done what entire armies\nand foreign potentates couldn't do you"}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 383170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 379390, "text": "have brought the american judicial\nsystem down to its knees."}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 387750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 383510, "text": "It's a towering achievement, Eddie, and\nyou did it with nothing but your own"}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 390090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 387750, "text": "incredible incompetence."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 395290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 390590, "text": "You are the Mount Everest of stupidity!"}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 399250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 397250, "text": "Is that some kind of a crack?"}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 405150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 401590, "text": "Eddie! Well, you know, because I'm with\nthe union, you know, and I don't have to"}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 406150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 405150, "text": "take cracks."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 409890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 408890, "text": "How about"}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 415060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 412900, "text": "Fielding. Your wife's flying. I don't\neven own a saddle."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 418060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 417060, "text": "Mac."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 421120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 418800, "text": "Oh, my God."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 425480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 422080, "text": "You look so rich."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 430340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 427540, "text": "Mac, Kwame, you guys look great."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 434280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 430700, "text": "How was your trip? Yeah, what exotic\nplace did you finally end up going to?"}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 435620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 434600, "text": "The Poconos."}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 441880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 440200, "text": "Thank you. Thank you. Thank you."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 446880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 442940, "text": "No, Harry, I'm sorry. But see, I got to\nconcentrate on my new career."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 448379, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 447520, "text": "What's that?"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 450080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 448380, "text": "Mack Robinson Enterprises."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 454800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 450440, "text": "I'm vice president in charge of parking\nmy butt in a Barco lounger."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 458340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 457340, "text": "Oh."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 463400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 459360, "text": "Oh, hey, cheer up. Hey, look, let's go\nto the cafeteria."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 465700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 463820, "text": "Lunch is on me."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 468380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 467040, "text": "Oh, Mack."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 472310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 468990, "text": "You inherit two million dollars and you\ntreat us to lunch in the cafeteria."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 474750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 473150, "text": "My thimble runneth over."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 483250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 478810, "text": "Look at this place."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 487130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 483730, "text": "You like it? I had Mason Maurice to come\nin and cater."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 488810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 487650, "text": "You're looking loose."}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 490130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 489130, "text": "Get out of this instant."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 494250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 491910, "text": "We have important snooty people coming."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 497130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 494930, "text": "Be cool, Maurice. These are my friends."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 499489, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 498570, "text": "Monsieur Robinson."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 503770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 499490, "text": "Oh, my humiliation is exploding in my\nface."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 509470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 505950, "text": "If you wish, I will cut my vein with a\nsnail fork."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 511850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 510110, "text": "Oh, that's okay."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 514610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 512169, "text": "I'll just knock a few hundred off your\ntip."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 516289, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 514830, "text": "Oh, merci, monsieur, merci."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 519770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 517110, "text": "You have made me as happy as a rotting\npig."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 523010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 520909, "text": "How many of us can truly say that?"}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 527710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 525310, "text": "Hello, mesdames et messieurs, s 'il vous\nplaît."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 531430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 528469, "text": "Merci beaucoup, Gaston. Très bon. Ah,\nparlez -vous français?"}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 532850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 531850, "text": "Bonjour, d 'abord."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 537210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 533430, "text": "Flip the flap, the Boeing Foygan."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 542690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 540630, "text": "All right, everybody, let's get started."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 544670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 543410, "text": "Maurice, read him the spread."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 551690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 546170, "text": "Today, you will be intimidated by...\nDoes"}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 556950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 551690, "text": "this mean we can't order the tuna log?"}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 560069, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 559150, "text": "What's this?"}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 561250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 560070, "text": "Those are your presents."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 563750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 561510, "text": "Oh, come on, guys. You've gone way too\nfar."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 566350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 564030, "text": "Come on, open them. You first, Bull."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 568270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 567270, "text": "Oh, wow."}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 570130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 568510, "text": "Where'd you find one in my size?"}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 571590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 570590, "text": "What is it?"}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 572870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 571810, "text": "It's a yo -yo."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 578710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 574370, "text": "Bull, that's got $25 ,000 worth of\ndiamonds in it."}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 580530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 579210, "text": "With an extra string."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 583370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 582370, "text": "What's this?"}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 587050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 583890, "text": "I get to see Mike Tyson at Madison\nSquare Garden?"}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 590870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 587350, "text": "No. you get to fight Mike Tyson at\nMadison Square Garden."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 596870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 594010, "text": "We got him to give you a three -round\nexhibition match."}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 603790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 597290, "text": "Oh, this is the loveliest, sweetest,\nmost thoughtful... I'll rip his freaking"}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 604790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 603790, "text": "head off."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 609710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 607290, "text": "Oh, Mac, I love caviar."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 611850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 609950, "text": "That's not just caviar, Christine."}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 616170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 612090, "text": "That's Romanovski Royale. There's only\ntwo fish in the whole world that make"}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 617170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 616170, "text": "that."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 618800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 617520, "text": "Edna and Bernice."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 621700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 620080, "text": "Okay, Dan, it's your turn."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 625600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 624600, "text": "My God."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 629020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 628020, "text": "It's a Rolex."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 632520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 631420, "text": "Read the inscription."}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 640360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 634600, "text": "Dear Dan, whether you believe it or not,\nI think of you as a friend."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 658370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 655610, "text": "Okay, Harry, you're the last one."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 661370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 658570, "text": "And I hope you like it, because I can't\nreturn it."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 667450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 664510, "text": "Dear Harry, stand up and count to four."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 669590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 668570, "text": "I don't get it."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 670850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 669850, "text": "Just do it."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 674650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 672670, "text": "One, two, three, four."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 699430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 694990, "text": "devil. Yes, and you've got them for the\nwhole night. You call the tune and they"}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 700430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 699430, "text": "will play it."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 702730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 700690, "text": "Mac, I don't know what to say."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 708170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 703650, "text": "Admiration feeds my body and emerges\nfrom my sphincter with joyous"}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 711890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 710790, "text": "Yeah, me too."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 713870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 712870, "text": "Come on, Maurice."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 717350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 714050, "text": "Let's break open a bottle of that 29\nRothschild."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 721830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 717850, "text": "29 Rothschild? It's worth about 950\nbucks a bottle."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 723960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 722600, "text": "I'll need a doggy glass."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 732360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 726920, "text": "Yeah. Don't you think you're being kind\nof extravagant here? You know, for once,"}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 734040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 732400, "text": "I want to be extravagant, Harry."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 738320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 734420, "text": "Hey, look, don't worry. I got it all\nfigured out. After spending all this,"}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 742120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 738320, "text": "still have $1 ,900 ,000 in the bank. Not\nenough. Huh?"}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 744080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 742500, "text": "Consider yourself served. What's this?"}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 745340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 744340, "text": "A summons."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 749640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 746780, "text": "You're being sued for $4 .5 million."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 767910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 764330, "text": "Okay, Mr. Clemmer, would you please tell\nme what this is all about? I represent"}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 770930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 767910, "text": "the owner of the office building where\nyou two operated your cafe."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 796530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 795530, "text": "been some kind of misunderstanding."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 800890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 797090, "text": "That's hardly how I would characterize\ndestroying the contents of a 30 -story"}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 801890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 800890, "text": "building."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 810910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 807410, "text": "You got you too, huh?"}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 816830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 812870, "text": "Matt, Quan Lee, look, don't talk to this\nman. You're not lawyers. I am. Let me"}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 817830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 816830, "text": "take care of this."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 821850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 818390, "text": "Mr. Klimmer, may I see a copy of the\nalleged complaint, please? Sure."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 830210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 826250, "text": "Can't sue for four and a half million\nbecause the stove explodes and starts a"}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 834630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 830210, "text": "fire, activating the sprinkler system,\ncreating a flood, blasting three"}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 841710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 836970, "text": "Well, I'll leave you to your future of\ndestitute squalor."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 845590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 843050, "text": "I hate to say this, Mac, but it looks\npretty bad."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 846890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 845890, "text": "How bad?"}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 858900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 857900, "text": "aren't you?"}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 861940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 860940, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 863640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 862640, "text": "I'm not mad."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 869060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 864260, "text": "Mac, if you're mad, you should be open\nabout it. Quan Li, I'm not really mad."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 870540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 869540, "text": "Of course you are."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 873140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 871020, "text": "I'm the one that wanted to open the\nrestaurant."}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 876800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 873720, "text": "It was my idea to save some money on a\nused stove."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 879580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 877180, "text": "I'm the one that canceled our liability\ninsurance."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 882400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 880180, "text": "If you're mad, say so."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 884160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 882920, "text": "Go with your feelings."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 891780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 889260, "text": "drawn and quartered."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 895240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 892100, "text": "I want you dropped into an active\nvolcano."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 899020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 895640, "text": "I want you shot out of a cannon onto a\ncactus."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 904900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 899240, "text": "I want you flung into a pit with every\ncarnivorous member of the reptile"}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 909240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 907740, "text": "I gotta take a walk."}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 925330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 924330, "text": "feel better?"}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 931890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 929070, "text": "Court's gonna have to wait a few\nminutes, Judge. I gotta hit the head."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 932890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 931890, "text": "on, Eddie."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 937850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 933170, "text": "You don't come waltzing in here and tell\nme that I have to wait. You see, I'm"}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 941170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 937850, "text": "the judge, and I tell you when court is\nin session."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 944910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 941830, "text": "Don't argue with me. Argue with the pork\nlasagna I ate."}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 947490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 946390, "text": "Vaya carnitas."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 952850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 950090, "text": "Oh, how I wish we could get Mac his job\nback."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 956240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 953100, "text": "Well, me too, but the problem is that\nonce you've handed in your resignation,"}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 959280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 956260, "text": "then you go right to the bottom of the\nwaiting list. Poor guy."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 962340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 959780, "text": "I feel awful about him having to take\nthat other job."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 966200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 965200, "text": "Hi, everybody."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 968320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 967220, "text": "Hi, Mac. Hi, Mac."}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 974440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 969300, "text": "So, uh, how are things down at Wally's\nWeenie Wonderland?"}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 977240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 976240, "text": "Oh, oh, great."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 978860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 977660, "text": "Uh, Mac?"}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 981520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 979160, "text": "Yeah? About those presents that you gave\nus?"}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 985520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 982040, "text": "I know that you wouldn't want us to\nreturn them. Oh, yeah, I want you to"}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 986520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 985520, "text": "them."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 988100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 986900, "text": "I need the money."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 992400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 988980, "text": "Mac, they wouldn't take the caviar back\nbecause it's a food item."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 995240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 992940, "text": "And they also said it would hurt Edna's\nfeelings."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 998560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 996080, "text": "And I can't even give away my fight with\nTyson."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 1003180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 999100, "text": "I mean, here's a chance to let a\nheavyweight champion boxer pummel you"}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 1004180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1003180, "text": "full minutes."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 1005580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1004220, "text": "Who wouldn't pay for that?"}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 1009660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1007340, "text": "But that bull did real well with the yo\n-yo."}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 1011220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1010220, "text": "I'm back."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 1013680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1012680, "text": "How much did you get?"}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 1018940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1013780, "text": "Well, I was on my way to return it, and\nit was so pretty, it just seemed like it"}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 1025800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1018940, "text": "was begging me, Bull, play with me"}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 1028200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1025800, "text": "just once."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 1031000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1029500, "text": "So I tried it, and..."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 1043720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1041520, "text": "I told you about listening to inanimate\nobjects."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1050000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1047859, "text": "Well, I guess that just leaves Dan's\nwatch."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1051400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1050400, "text": "Hi, guys."}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1055440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1051880, "text": "Dan, you know the watch that Matt gave\nyou?"}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1057040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1056040, "text": "Watch?"}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1062800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1057780, "text": "Yeah, the $5 ,000 Rolex that he gave you\nabout two days ago, and you already"}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1064300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1062800, "text": "hocked it, didn't you?"}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1065540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1064540, "text": "It was mine."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1069580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1067120, "text": "Besides, I only got three grand for it.\nThree?"}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1073290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1070130, "text": "Yeah, you know what, too? I had to pay\nto get that engraving buffed off the"}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1074290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1073290, "text": "of it."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1076610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1075610, "text": "Oh, no."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1080510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1079510, "text": "Dan?"}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1084430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1082430, "text": "Nobody gets my money."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1089210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1088210, "text": "Dan?"}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1095210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1091690, "text": "Stop it. Stop that. Do not look at me\nwith those hound dog eyes. Stop it."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1104640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1102920, "text": "Why don't you just rip out a kidney\nwhile you're at it?"}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1107220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1105420, "text": "Oh, thanks, Dad."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1112340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1107560, "text": "Now all I gotta do to pay off the debt\nis to liquidate everything I own, work"}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1117280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1112340, "text": "three jobs, sell two pints of blood\nbefore I start my paper route."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1120740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1117480, "text": "Oh, Lord, I'm so poor."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1123980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1121780, "text": "Oh, Matt, come on, big guy."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1127680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1124540, "text": "My great -grandchildren are gonna be\nwearing this sweater."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1131500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1129040, "text": "Well, you know, the classics never\nreally go out of style."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1135020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1134020, "text": "Sorry."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1137680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1135260, "text": "Oh, I feel so bad."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1142940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1138820, "text": "I feel like that yellow stuff that\nfloats on top of the chili."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1150780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1145040, "text": "Matt, come on. You shouldn't see... What\nthe heck is that stuff anyway?"}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1154820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1151980, "text": "Come on, Matt. Money's not so important."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1156760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1155020, "text": "It's not just the money."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1159920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1157460, "text": "And it's not that I feel like such a\nfailure."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1163990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1161290, "text": "It's those terrible things I said to\nKwan Lee."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1167790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1165330, "text": "Yep. They were pretty bad."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1169530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1168530, "text": "Kwan Lee!"}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1172350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1169890, "text": "Hi, Mac. I have to tell you something."}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1173950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1172670, "text": "No, you listen to me first."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1181290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1175790, "text": "I don't give a damn about being poor as\nlong as I have you with me."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1187390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1181490, "text": "Mac. And I want you to know that I love\nyou more than anything in the whole"}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1188390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1187390, "text": "world."}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1191160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1189900, "text": "I love you too, Mac."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1193520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1192420, "text": "And you were right."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1197380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1194020, "text": "The whole thing was my fault. It doesn't\nmatter."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1200140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1198040, "text": "That's why I decided to do something."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1203740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1202740, "text": "Uh -oh."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1206240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1204380, "text": "I talked to the owner of the building."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1208220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1207220, "text": "Uh -oh."}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1211540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1210080, "text": "I suggest Ecuador."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1217260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1214040, "text": "Quan Li, I don't mean to be harsh, but\nare you nuts?"}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1220480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1218320, "text": "He's going to settle for $1 ,950 ,000."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1223560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1220760, "text": "There. Now, you see, you may not be able\nto back out of that."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1229000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1223760, "text": "You should... Did you say $1 ,950 ,000?\nYep. I told him if he settled for the"}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1231220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1229000, "text": "actual damages, I'd write him a check\ntomorrow."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1235900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1231940, "text": "Otherwise, we'd tie it up in court till\nhe was too old to spend it on anything"}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1238380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1235900, "text": "but denture cream and Preparation 8."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1242060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1240880, "text": "That's my girl."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1243440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1242440, "text": "Hey, man."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1246680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1243620, "text": "$1 ,950 ,000. Isn't that about exactly\nwhat you've got?"}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1248280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1247280, "text": "Wait a minute."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1256080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1250560, "text": "A million nine, plus the stuff I return,\nplus the 3 ,000 from Dan,"}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1258840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1256280, "text": "150 for selling the pinto."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1263620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1261400, "text": "Oh, my God, baby."}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1266380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1264000, "text": "We are worth nothing."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1270920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1268780, "text": "Yeah. Excuse me. Yeah."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1273240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1271200, "text": "You're rejoicing about being worth\nnothing?"}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1277000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1273820, "text": "Yeah, we were a thousand bucks in the\nhole before this all started."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1279520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1277940, "text": "Hey, Judge, we got to talk."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1281360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1280020, "text": "About what, Eddie?"}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1282940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1281940, "text": "I'm quitting."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1284039, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1283120, "text": "You're what?"}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1286480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1284040, "text": "Look, I can't take this badgering. Do\nthis."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1287999, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1287020, "text": "File that."}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1289000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1288000, "text": "Wake up."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1292100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1289900, "text": "You people are just relentless."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1294700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1292540, "text": "You can have this job back if you want\nit."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1298120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1295540, "text": "I wish I could, but I already handed in\nmy resignation."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1302380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1301380, "text": "To Eddie."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1305140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1304140, "text": "That's right."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1309560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1305660, "text": "Eddie, if you were in charge of it, then\nyou must have lost it, right?"}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1311160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1310160, "text": "Hell no."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1312800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1311240, "text": "I know exactly where it is."}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1314300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1313280, "text": "It's right in the top drawer."}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1319160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1318160, "text": "I don't see it."}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1320580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1319300, "text": "It's stuck to my hikey."}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1324040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1323040, "text": "Here it is."}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1325400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1324300, "text": "Well, rip it up."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1327100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1325880, "text": "I don't know if I want to touch it."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1330540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1328420, "text": "You want to spend the rest of your life\nin that hat?"}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1350930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1349710, "text": "I was just saying goodbye and nothing."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1353110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1352110, "text": "Oh, Eddie."}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1354310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1353310, "text": "We're sorry."}
{"cue": 343, "end_ms": 1360770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1354950, "text": "Tell you what. As a token of our\nappreciation, we'd like you to have"}
{"cue": 344, "end_ms": 1366330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1364270, "text": "What is it? A fight ticket."}
{"cue": 345, "end_ms": 1369650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1366570, "text": "Yep. You just show them that at the gate\nand they'll take care of you."}
{"cue": 346, "end_ms": 1374750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1373750, "text": "Mike Tyson."}
{"cue": 347, "end_ms": 1376750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1375490, "text": "Is this ringside?"}
{"cue": 348, "end_ms": 1379170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1378170, "text": "Better."}
{"cue": 349, "end_ms": 1391600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1390600, "text": "but to one friend."}
